{"channelId":"UCRZiF8Y_8y5zozbWEKO3f1Q","row":["Tallo",414,"Tallo bridges the gap between talent and opportunity, empowering both individuals and organizations to transform uncertainty into confident, purposeful connections. \n \nFor talent seekers, we're a modern recruitment platform that connects talent-driven organizations with skilled candidates, moving beyond reactive hiring to proactive talent discovery. \n \nFor individuals ages 13-30, we serve as a trusted guide through career exploration, skill development, and meaningful connections that align with their unique abilities and goals. \n \nOur mission is to enable individuals to explore careers, build valuable credentials, and ultimately secure roles that lead to better lives. We envision being the co-pilot that helps navigate from career uncertainty to confident action, providing the tools and connections for lasting success.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRZiF8Y_8y5zozbWEKO3f1Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRZiF8Y_8y5zozbWEKO3f1Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:53.337Z","channelId":"UCRZiF8Y_8y5zozbWEKO3f1Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"1052b0df9d384af28607e01aa5211117146d954eeaa74ab7f3afbab2e5340d2a","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"fd26d42c67ba2813ec0393157249185f3bce5d49043a6af8bb13c27de5be01c6"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRZiF8Y_8y5zozbWEKO3f1Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:53.337Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRZiF8Y_8y5zozbWEKO3f1Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":414,"raw":"414 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRZiF8Y_8y5zozbWEKO3f1Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:53.337Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"singl